{\*\ftnsep\chftnsep}\pgndec\pard\plain \s1\rtlch\afs48\ab\ltrch\fs48\b\ql\sb240\sa283\ltrpar{
Notes on Listening}
\par \pard\plain \s22\sb0\sa283\ql\sb0\sa283\ltrpar{
This short document is written for Mimick's checks. It is laid out as a word processor would lay it out, with headings, a list and a table, so the reader can be tested on something other than a PDF.}
\par \pard\plain \s2\sb200\sa120\rtlch\af8\afs36\ab\ltrch\hich\af3\afs36\ab\dbch\af6\loch\f3\fs36\b\ql\sb200\sa120\ltrpar{
Why listen}
\par \pard\plain \s22\sb0\sa283\ql\sb0\sa283\ltrpar{
Hearing a text while following it on the page keeps the pace steady. The eyes and the ears hold each other to the line.}
\par \pard\plain \s22\sb0\sa283{\listtext\pard\plain \rtlch\af4\ltrch\hich\af4\dbch\af4\loch\f4 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls2 \fi-283\li0\lin0\ql\tx709\fi-283\li709\lin709\sb0\sa0\ltrpar{
Listening helps when attention drifts. }
\par \pard\plain \s22\sb0\sa283{\listtext\pard\plain \rtlch\af4\ltrch\hich\af4\dbch\af4\loch\f4 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls2 \fi-283\li0\lin0\ql\tx709\fi-283\li709\lin709\ltrpar{
A faster voice can hold attention better. }
\par \pard\plain \s2\sb200\sa120\rtlch\af8\afs36\ab\ltrch\hich\af3\afs36\ab\dbch\af6\loch\f3\fs36\b\ql\sb200\sa120\ltrpar{
How to begin}
\par \pard\plain \s22\sb0\sa283\ql\sb0\sa283\ltrpar{
Open the file, press the space bar, and follow the words that are lit.}
